<h1 style="color: #030913; font-size: 24px; line-height: 32px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 24px 0; text-align: center;">
  Account Removed
</h1>

<p style="color: #304254; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
  Your Hex.pm account <strong><%= @username %></strong> has been removed by the Hex.pm administrators.
</p>

<p style="color: #304254; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
  Reason: <%= @reason %>
</p>

<p style="color: #304254; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
  If you believe this was a mistake, please reply to this email or contact support@hex.pm.
</p>
